* Filtro activo Sallen-Key pasa-altas - Opamp ideal (nullator + norator)
* Entrada senoidal Vi = 1 mV
* Valores nuevos: RA = RB = 1.59k, C1 = C2 = 0.1u
* K = 1 + RB/RA = 2 (6.02 dB)
* f0 = 1/(2*pi*R*C) ~ 1 kHz
* Q = 1



V1 1 0 DC 0 AC 1m

* Capacitores
C1 1 2 0.1u
C2 2 3 0.1u

* R_G1 = 1/G1 = RA ; R_G2 = 1/G2 = RB
R_G1 2 5 1590
R_G2 3 0 1590

* Red de ganancia
R_B 4 5 1590
R_A 4 0 1590

* Opamp ideal: (+)=3  (-)=4  salida=5
O_A1 3 4 5 0

.AC DEC 75 10 12k
.PRINT AC V(1) V(2) V(3) V(4) V(5) I(R_B) I(V1)
.PROBE AC V(1) V(2) V(3) V(4) V(5) I(R_B) I(V1)
.OPTION POST=2
.OP
.END
